From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:30:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: h616: Put mixer 0 behind the IOMMU

Mixer 0 is the DRM device's DMA device (sun8i_mixer_bind), so it needs
the IOMMU the planes fetch through, or every buffer is mapped where the
planes cannot read it.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi
@@ -245,6 +245,7 @@
 					 <&display_clocks CLK_MIXER0>;
 				clock-names = "bus", "mod";
 				resets = <&display_clocks RST_MIXER0>;
+				iommus = <&iommu 0>;
 				allwinner,planes = <&planes>;
 
 				ports {
-- 
2.47.3
